   "from": "Ministry of Agriculture and Commerce",
   "to": "",
   "about": "Prescribes the establishment, staffing, courses, reporting and closure of prefectural fisheries schools.",
   "summary": "The regulations define prefectural fisheries schools and their branches, staff and instructional purposes. They specify course lengths, require ministerial permission to establish or abolish schools, and require annual reports. The heading records amendments through 1939.",
